&lt;h5 class="smt_head4"&gt; &lt;/h5&gt;</jpigp_cor:NotesPropertyPlantAndEquipmentConsolidatedFinancialStatementsIFRSTextBlock>
  <jpigp_cor:NotesGoodwillAndIntangibleAssetsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsIFRSTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;12．のれん及び無形資産&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;のれん及び無形資産の取得原価ならびに償却累計額及び減損損失累計額の増減、帳簿価額は以下のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5 class="smt_head4"&gt;①　取得原価&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:483.8pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
